{"id":10089,"name":"salamence-mega","speciesId":373,"dex":373,"form":"mega","generation":3,"types":["dragon","flying"],"stats":{"hp":95,"attack":145,"defense":130,"special-attack":120,"special-defense":90,"speed":120},"abilities":[{"name":"aerilate","hidden":false}],"height":18,"weight":1126,"baseExp":315,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10089.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10089.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10089.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10089.ogg","genus":"Dragon Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"ruby","text":"SALAMENCE came about as a result of a strong, long-held dream of growing wings. It is said that this powerful desire triggered a sudden mutation in this POKéMON’s cells, causing it to sprout its magnificent wings."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"By evolving into SALAMENCE, this POKéMON finally realizes its long-held dream of growing wings. To express its joy, it flies and wheels all over the sky while spouting flames from its mouth."},{"version":"emerald","text":"After many long years, its cellular structure underwent a sudden mutation to grow wings. When angered, it loses all thought and rampages out of control."},{"version":"firered","text":"It becomes uncontrollable if it is enraged. It destroys everything with shredding claws and fire."},{"version":"diamond","text":"As a result of its long-held dream of flying, its cellular structure changed, and wings grew out."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It’s uncontrollable if enraged. It flies around spouting flames and scorching fields and mountains."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Salamence came about as a result of a strong, long-held dream of growing wings. It is said that this powerful desire triggered a sudden mutation in this Pokémon’s cells, causing it to sprout its magnificent wings."},{"version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"By evolving into Salamence, this Pokémon finally realizes its long-held dream of growing wings. To express its joy, it flies and wheels all over the sky while spouting flames from its mouth."},{"version":"sun","text":"When angered, it loses all sense of itself and destroys everything around it. The destruction will continue until Salamence has tired itself out."},{"version":"moon","text":"It flies around on its wings, which have grown in at last. In its happiness, it gushes hot flames, burning up the fields it passes over."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Overjoyed at finally being able to fly, it flies all over the place and usually doesn’t land until it’s completely exhausted and needs to sleep."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Thanks to its fervent wishes, the cells in its body finally mutated, and at last it has its heart’s desire—wings."},{"version":"sword","text":"Salamence is an unusual Pokémon in that it was able to evolve a body with wings just by constantly wishing to be able to fly."},{"version":"shield","text":"While basking in the joy of flight generally keeps this Pokémon in high spirits, Salamence turns into an uncontrollable menace if something angers it."}],"genderRate":4,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["dragon"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"bagon","speciesId":371,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 30"],"species":"shelgon","speciesId":372,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 50"],"species":"salamence","speciesId":373,"evolvesTo":[]}]}]},"varieties":[{"id":373,"name":"salamence","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/373.png"},{"id":10089,"name":"salamence-mega","form":"mega","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10089.png"}],"games":[16,17,18],"moves":[{"id":15,"learn":[[